# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# /api/*  is served by Cloudflare Pages Functions in /functions/api/, so
# we MUST NOT rewrite it — leaving it unmatched lets the Functions router
# claim it. The catch-all below sends everything else to the SPA shell.
#
# /sitemap.xml is exposed at its canonical URL by rewriting to the
# Pages Function at /api/sitemap. /pinterest-feed.csv similarly
# exposes the Pinterest Catalog product feed at a clean public URL
# that Pinterest's Catalog Manager can ingest on a schedule.

/sitemap.xml          /api/sitemap         200
/pinterest-feed.csv   /api/pinterest-feed  200
/*                    /index.html          200
